                                                "sense_id": "3da3ae76-e5aa-3d53-87aa-bba27907b8dc",
                                                "text": "Some evolutionary theorists stress that cultural innovation allows human beings to overcome the blind stumblings of natural selection: we deliberately solve a problem and pass on that solution to our descendants, who improve on it in turn."
